    "mustNotInterfereTargetPrice": true,
    "adjustWhenInterferes": true,
    "priorityNote": "Limited discount is the guaranteed fallback price layer when ordinary marketing is not enough. Coupons are not guaranteed to trigger, so do not rely on ordinary marketing + 15% coupon as the primary guaranteed price stack; cancel/recreate or adjust limited discounts when the guaranteed base price would be lower or higher than the intended target. Unless the user explicitly requests otherwise, fallback limited-discount activity stock is exactly 10 and the activity window is 7 days."
