    "fixedPricePolicy": "do_not_override_fixed_price_or_row_override",
    "sourceNote": "Top links are ranked globally per standard_goods_sn across all stores and all links. Ranking uses positive 7-day exposure first; only when a whole standard_goods_sn has no positive 7-day exposure does it fall back to 30-day/total exposure. Rows with no positive metric in the selected fallback tier are not used for top-link ranking; if exposure data is unavailable, scripts keep the base margin and mark the exposure rule as not applied."
  },
